The Go Programming Language, 2nd edition — example programs
===========================================================

Chapters 1 to 13 of this repository are derived from the example programs
accompanying the first edition of "The Go Programming Language":

    Copyright (c) 2016 Alan A. A. Donovan & Brian W. Kernighan
    https://github.com/adonovan/gopl.io
    Licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0

Those programs have been modified: io/ioutil replaced by io and os, the cgo
helpers in ch13/bzip made static, ch8/cake's testing.Verbose call moved out of
package initialization, ch12/methods' example functions renamed and their
expected output updated, and the //!+ excerpt markers removed. See README.md
for the full list.

Chapters 14 to 20 are new work.

Because the first edition's programs are licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, this
repository as a whole is distributed under the same licence (see LICENSE):
attribution required, non-commercial use only, and derivative works must be
shared under the same terms.

This repository contains example programs only. The text of the book is not
included and is not covered by this licence.
